  "boats": 3,
  "mountain": "Mount Fuji",
  "notes": "Scene copies the print's composition: giant curling wave left with claw-like foam, three low-poly boats (one cargo boat at left, two passenger boats riding swells center-right and foreground), small snow-capped Mount Fuji low center-right between troughs, right-side swell ridge, cream paper sky with grey haze around Fuji. Palette sampled from the print: Prussian deep blue, mid blue, pale steel blue, cream foam, tan boats. Gentle motion: animated swell bands, bobbing boats, drifting spray, pulsing foam."
